## Setup

1. Clone the repository:
```bash
git clone https://github.com/deepak3192hp/Credit-Score-Classification.git
cd Credit-Score-Classification
```

2. Create a virtual environment:
```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
```

3. Install dependencies:
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

4. Run the training script:
```bash
python credit_score_model.py --data-path data/Credit_Score_Classification_Train.csv
```

5. Optional: open the Jupyter notebook to explore the analysis interactively:
```bash
jupyter notebook
```

